                      "code": "$ jsonui-test contracts coverage --platform web\ncontracts coverage  (project platforms: web, android, ios)\napp contracts: docs/screens/json/app_contracts.spec.json · apiOutcomeRules 1\n[platform=web] spec=profile_screen  units 1  contracted methods 1 of 1\n  statuses required 5 = row 3 (alsoStatuses 1) + unit 1 + unreachable 0 + unexpressible 0 + not-evaluated 0 + uncovered 1\n    uncovered 1 = partial 1 + default-only 0 + unattributed 0\n  uncovered  partial       onTapSave × api.updateProfile  PUT /api/items  422\n  info  guard-only 1 · note branches 1 · also_statuses_rows 1 · also_statuses_arrange_differs 0 · side_calls_admitted 0 · reference_holds_on_success_row 0 · route_overlaps 0 · dataFlow methods without endpoint 0\n  outside required 0 = unreached-op 0 + n/a(default response) 0 + n/a(no scenario) 0 + n/a(platform-excluded) 0\n  n/a (E) no mock 0 · not in OpenAPI 0 · unbound endpoint 0 · non-HTTP 0\n[platform=web] total n/a(no mock) 0 (screens 0) · n/a(not in OpenAPI) 0 (screens 0) · n/a(unbound endpoint) 0 (screens 0) · n/a(non-HTTP) 0 (screens 0)\n[platform=web] exit 1 (uncovered)\nexit 1 (composed 2 > 1 > 3 > 0): 1 uncovered — write a row (alsoStatuses if the VM treats it like another status), or an exclusion with a reason",
