                      "topMargin": 12,
                      "code": "bucket                    | a status lands here when\nrow                       | a row serves it in `when` by scenario name — the route's default scenario is\n                          | not an answer — and the row's `then` says more than \"the op was reached\";\n                          | an alsoStatuses copy counts here and is reported apart\nunit                      | excludedOutcomes, by: unit — a unit test covers it\nunreachable               | excludedOutcomes, by: unreachable — it cannot arrive here\nunexpressible             | excludedOutcomes, by: unexpressible — only a note branch could say it\nnot-evaluated             | the method's row for the op could not be bound\nuncovered · partial       | the method answers other statuses of the op, not this one\nuncovered · default-only  | the method reaches the op but answers none of its statuses\nuncovered · unattributed  | no method's rows reach the op, and unreachedOps does not say why\noutside required          | unreached-op (unreachedOps says why) · n/a(default response)\n                          | · n/a(no scenario) · n/a(platform-excluded)",
                      "language": "text",
                      "filename": "every documented status, exactly one bucket",
